    "# 2. Baseline Train/Test Split\n",
    "\n",
    "A standard workflow is:\n",
    "\n",
    "**Data → Training Set + Test Set → Fit Model → Evaluate**\n",
    "\n",
    "But one split gives only one estimate of future performance."
   ]
